From: illumos-drm <illumos-drm@code.aopc.cloud>
Subject: [PATCH 07] amdgpu_display.c: no fbdev framebuffer on illumos

amdgpu_display_suspend_helper() unpins every framebuffer except fbdev's
(drm_fb_helper_gem_is_fb(dev->fb_helper, ...)). illumos has no fbdev
emulation and the facade's struct drm_device no fb_helper, so no
framebuffer is fbdev's.

License: a preprocessor guard in an MIT file; applied to the pinned Linux
tree.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_display.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_display.c
index f5cd68542..d4e009787 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_display.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_display.c
@@ -1774,7 +1774,12 @@ int amdgpu_display_suspend_helper(struct amdgpu_device *adev)
 		if (!fb || !fb->obj[0])
 			continue;
 
+#ifdef __illumos__
+		/* No fbdev emulation on illumos: no framebuffer is fbdev's. */
+		if (true) {
+#else
 		if (!drm_fb_helper_gem_is_fb(dev->fb_helper, fb->obj[0])) {
+#endif
 			struct amdgpu_bo *robj = gem_to_amdgpu_bo(fb->obj[0]);
 
 			r = amdgpu_bo_reserve(robj, true);
